# Humour is editorial content rather than UI translation. Keep it outside TEXT
# so each language can have its own native set and its own number of lines. The
# voice is the timer itself: loyal, limited, and mildly amused by the fact that
# its one reliable skill is counting time. It can be wrong, slow or useless, but
# should never sound as though it knows the user better than the user does.
